action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P131 taps three places. 130 points right of the "Gap left" label is the empty
# gap of an HStack given contentShape(Rectangle()), which must register "gap".
# 52 points up and left of "Circle target" is a corner of a square given
# contentShape(Circle()): outside the circle, so the tap must pass through to the
# grey square underneath ("under"). The label itself is the centre and must
# register "circle". Then the same two places of "Hold target" are long-pressed:
# the corner must reach the grey square's long press ("lp-under"), the centre the
# circle's ("lp-circle").
# The long presses are a press held for 1.2 s at the place a tap row has just put
# the pointer (a tap there does nothing). Then the pointer moves to the corner of
# the green square at client (16,16)-(116,116), outside its contentShape(Circle()),
# "Hover mark" is tapped, and the pointer moves to the centre: onHover must start
# there and not at the corner, so the hits after PASS are mark, hover-in.
# On WinUI a buttonless move is ten SendInput steps (Win32Synthesiser.move) along the straight line, so the moves from the hold target to the corner and from the corner to the mark crossed the circle and hover started twice, correctly (measured with the -contentshape diagnostics, 2026-11-25). The pointer therefore goes round the square along x 211 and y 4.
#
# expect: log-contains P131 PASS WITH HOVER
#
# P131 點擊三處。"Gap left" 標籤右方 130 點是加上 contentShape(Rectangle()) 的 HStack 的空隙，必須記為「gap」。
# "Circle target" 左上方 52 點是加上 contentShape(Circle()) 的正方形的角落：在圓外，所以點擊必須穿透到下方的灰色
# 正方形(「under」)。標籤本身就是中心，必須記為「circle」。接著對 "Hold target" 的同樣兩處長按：角落必須抵達灰色
# 正方形的長按(「lp-under」),中心必須抵達圓的長按(「lp-circle」)。長按是在前一列點擊剛放好指標之處按住 1.2 秒
# (在那裡點一下什麼都不做)。然後指標移到 client (16,16)-(116,116) 綠色正方形的角落，在其 contentShape(Circle())
# 之外，點「Hover mark」,再移到中心:onHover 必須在那裡、而不是在角落開始，因此 PASS 之後的命中是 mark、hover-in。
# 在 WinUI 上，沒按鍵的移動是 10 段 SendInput(Win32Synthesiser.move),會沿直線經過途中的點：從 Hold target 到角落、從角落到 mark 的直線都穿過圓，讓 hover 正確地開始了兩次(2026-11-25 以 -contentshape 診斷量得)。所以指標沿 x 211 與 y 4 繞過正方形。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P131 render,windows
taplabel,130,0,,,Gap left,,the empty gap must register,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
taplabel,-52,-52,,,Circle target,,corner outside the circle must reach grey,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
taplabel,,,,,Circle target,,centre must reach the circle,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
taplabel,-52,-52,,,Hold target,,put the pointer there; a tap does nothing,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,past the double-click time,windows
mousedown,,,,left,,,press and hold there,windows
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,windows
mouseup,,,,left,,,the long press at the corner must reach grey,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
taplabel,,,,,Hold target,,put the pointer there; a tap does nothing,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,past the double-click time,windows
mousedown,,,,left,,,press and hold there,windows
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,windows
mouseup,,,,left,,,the long press at the centre must reach the circle,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
move,211,4,,,,,up from the hold target along x 211: the straight line to the corner would cross the circle,windows
move,8,4,,,,,left along y 4 above the green square,windows
move,22,22,,,,,corner of the green square: outside its circle,windows
sleep,,,,,,600000,,windows
move,22,4,,,,,up from the corner first: WinUI moves are stepped and a straight line to the mark would cross the circle,windows
move,170,4,,,,,along y 4 above the square to its right,windows
taplabel,,,,,Hover mark,,mark: hover must not have started yet,windows
sleep,,,,,,600000,,windows
move,66,66,,,,,centre of the green square: hover starts here,windows
sleep,,,,,,2000000,let the verdict show,windows
